  // projectile: Shell (default), Bullet, Missile (guided, always follows its target), Rocket, Flame, Bomb.
  // targets: Ground (default), Air or All. burst: shots per trigger, burstInterval apart; the cooldown follows the last.
  // clip: a magazine fired as a stream, one round per cooldown at the target it bears on, then clipReload s to change it.
  // roundWeight: how heavy a round looks and sounds (tracer, report) when its damage is not its calibre's (a faster gun's lighter rounds).
  // load: an aircraft's stores (bombs, missiles, rockets) per full load (prompt 13 C): a salvo fires what is left; the rounds
  // come back over the field (the carrier's "rearmTime" from empty at the holding pattern's full rate, "loads" per carrier).
  // flareResist: the share of flare decoys a missile's seeker sees through (0-1; radar-guided SAMs most of them, prompt 13).
  // real, family, size (prompt 13 B): the real weapon, its family and its round's size (calibre in mm, or a missile's,
  // bomb's or drone's kg). Damage a round follows the size within a family (the same real weapon hits the same on
  // every carrier); a weapon's strength is its cadence, magazine, reload, accuracy and reach.
